### 2.5 Middleware matchers (`middleware.ts` @ SHA)

```
'/', '/capture', '/app', '/simplifiorb', '/workspace', '/login', '/register',
'/forgot-password', '/reset-password',
'/portal/:slug', '/portal/:slug/:path*',
'/admin/:path*', '/launch',
'/:slug', '/:slug/:path*'
```

**`/trust` is not in the matcher.** Public portal auth paths: `/portal/login`, `/portal/sign-in`, `/portal/register`, `/portal/forgot-password`, `/portal/reset-password`. Public admin paths: `/admin/login`, `/admin/sign-in`, `/admin/register`, `/admin/forgot-password`, `/admin/reset-password`.

