## 3. Navigation registry

### 3.1 Client Experience — `lib/ctp-client-nav.ts` + `ClientExperienceNav.tsx` @ `545c6251`

`buildClientExperienceNav(slug)` returns (exact order):

| # | id | label | href helper | menu placement |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | journey | **Your Journey** | `opportunityDashboardPath` → `/portal/{slug}/ctp` | **primary** (first) |
| 2 | progress | **Progress** | `designStudioPath` → `/portal/{slug}/ctp/progress` | **primary** |
| 3 | documents | **Documents** | `ctp/documents` | **primary** |
| 4 | messages | **Messages** | `ctp/messages` | **primary** |
| 5 | support | **Support** | `ctp/support` | **primary** |

Rendering (`ClientExperienceNav.tsx` @ SHA): **all five** use the same `cex-shell-link` class; **no** quiet/secondary split; **no** Account `<details>`; logout is a direct `Log out` link (`cex-shell-logout`) → `/api/portal/logout`.

Shown when `shouldUseClientExperienceShell(slug)` (CTP submission bound).

