## 10. Pass 1 structural observations (inventory only — not Pass 2)

1. Canonical Guide route is `/ctp/progress` (`designStudioPath`), but CX nav labels it **Progress** and places **Your Journey** first.
2. Help is multi-homed: Support + Messages + FAQ FAB + Assistant.
3. FAQ text can increase confusion (§6.2).
4. MCC Operate is a tight 7-item list; Build remains 11 peers.
5. Orphaned components and missing command-bar API remain in tree.
6. Trust/Legal/reacceptance surfaces are **not** in this commit (appear only in later WIP); production `/trust` **404** confirms.
7. Public health + auth gates behave as designed on production (runtime Verified).
8. Cert tenant password login works until portal email 2FA; without inbox or production HMAC secret, authenticated CX cannot be certified.

